<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-15983] Regression when using SELECT (EXISTS (...)) part 2</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-15983</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;In the task &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-14354&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-14354&lt;/a&gt; erroneous queries were not fully corrected.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;So, a query like&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
CREATE TABLE t (i &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;int&lt;/span&gt; PRIMARY KEY, j &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;int&lt;/span&gt;);
SELECT (EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM t WHERE t.i = 1));&#160; &lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;now passes, when a query&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
CREATE TABLE t (i &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;int&lt;/span&gt; PRIMARY KEY, j &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;int&lt;/span&gt;);
SELECT (EXISTS (SELECT i FROM t WHERE t.i = 1));&#160; &lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;still fails.&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The original cause of the error must be fixed.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
